<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>beam: third-party licences</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 6px; }
  li { margin: 0.1rem 0; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>beam is built with the open-source crates listed below. Each is used
unmodified; its source is on crates.io at the link next to its name. beam's
own licence is in <code>LICENSE.md</code>, and the bundled fonts and icons are
in <code>licenses/</code>.</p>

<h2>By licence</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
